step Twitching Antennae
  zone The Barrens
  only Warrior
  tip The antennae vanish fifteen minutes after they drop: kill the Silithid Swarmers and Creepers at the Silithid Mounds in the Field of Giants, south of Camp Taurajo, until you have five, then take them straight to Ruga Ragetotem in Camp Taurajo, before the thunderhawks. Careful: Silithid Swarmers (level 21-22) cast Silithid Swarm both in and out of combat, which brings several small adds; Silithid Creepers (level 20-21) periodically cast Silithid Creeper Egg in combat, which spawns extra adds. A Silithid Harvester (24, rare) also wanders the mounds: leave it.
  collect 7119 quest 1824.1           -- Twitching Antennae from the silithid

step Ruga Ragetotem
  zone The Barrens
  only Warrior
  tip Back north into Camp Taurajo before the antennae fade: Ruga Ragetotem is inside.
  turnin 1824 only Warrior            -- Ruga Ragetotem, inside
  accept 1825 only Warrior

