# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Sludge Fen (Rogues)

step Taskmaster Fizzule
  only Rogue
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fizzule is by the Venture Co. tower north of the Sludge Fen. Before you go near him, use {item:8051} to fire two flares, then target him and /salute: he attacks anyone who comes in without signalling first.
  turnin 2458                         -- Taskmaster Fizzule
  accept 2478 optional
  note Mission: Possible But Not Probable is for level 23 or more: the tower's drones are 25 and Gallywix a 23 elite. Do it when you can, with a group, from the Class guide Poisons (Horde).

step Field of Giants
  label q868
  zone The Barrens
  tip South of Camp Taurajo, on the road to Gann, the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them. Silithid Harvesters are rare: if you see one, kill it for its head.
  collect 5058 quest 868.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead

